														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-845618">
									

<p>There's just… Well, there's just not much to it. The actual article is about six lines of text. It doesn't say anything at all about what the SCP does. The closest it gets is mentioning that it appears differently to different subjects. How? What does it do? Sure, you can get a basic idea of what it does from the logs, but that information really needs to be in the entry proper.</p>
<p>Also, what happens if you send two people in at once? Or a robotic drone? Does everyone who goes in end up disappearing? If so, why isn't that mentioned in the article? Have they tried attaching leads to the subjects to haul them out?</p>
<p>The basic idea seems interesting, but this needs a substantial rewrite.</p>

